{"textboxes":[{"x":688.0,"y":592.0,"connect0_ID":2.0,"portrait_ind":7.0,"ID":0.0,"text":"<nopause>Hey, <yespause>fella. Not to bother ya, but we got somewhere to be.","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)"},{"x":1440.0,"y":608.0,"connect0_ID":3.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"ID":1.0,"text":"<char_speak ogre>Nah. I'm gettin' my tan on.","portrait":-4.0},{"x":1104.0,"y":608.0,"connect0_ID":1.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"ID":2.0,"text":"You mind lettin' us cross right here?","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)"},{"x":1456.0,"y":720.0,"connect0_ID":4.0,"portrait_ind":12.0,"ID":3.0,"text":"...In the middle of the road?","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)"},{"x":1088.0,"y":704.0,"connect0_ID":5.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"ID":4.0,"text":"<char_speak ogre>Yeah, this spot rocks. I can feel my attraction levels rising by the second.","portrait":-4.0},{"x":624.0,"y":704.0,"connect0_ID":6.0,"portrait_ind":100.0,"ID":5.0,"text":"Um... I guess we'll just have to find another way around?","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_bridget)"},{"x":672.0,"y":848.0,"portrait_ind":23.0,"ID":6.0,"text":"Screw that.<break>We'll find a way to move him.","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)"},{"x":736.0,"y":1024.0,"connect0_ID":9.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"ID":8.0,"text":"<char_speak ogre>The Wizard sent me here to set up a floating block puzzle.","portrait":-4.0},{"x":1152.0,"y":1024.0,"connect0_ID":10.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"ID":9.0,"text":"<char_speak ogre>But damn, the sun from this angle?<break>Had to whip out da blankie.","portrait":-4.0},{"x":1568.0,"y":1024.0,"portrait_ind":37.0,"ID":10.0,"text":"Guy's a psycho.<break>There's gotta be a way to move him...","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)"},{"x":640.0,"y":1232.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"ID":11.0,"text":"<auto 70><char_speak ogre>OH, DAMN!","portrait":-4.0},{"x":928.0,"y":1232.0,"connect0_ID":13.0,"portrait_ind":6.0,"ID":12.0,"text":"WOAH! He went soaring!<break>How'd you know he'd do that?","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_bridget)"},{"x":1312.0,"y":1216.0,"connect0_ID":14.0,"portrait_ind":9.0,"ID":13.0,"text":"Okay to be completely honest I had no idea that would happen.","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)"},{"x":1728.0,"y":1216.0,"portrait_ind":25.0,"ID":14.0,"text":"But that was the coolest thing I ever saw.","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)"},{"x":-160.0,"y":1056.0,"connect0_ID":18.0,"portrait_ind":0.0,"ID":17.0,"text":"<char_speak ogre>Why do you keep talking to me?","portrait":-4.0},{"x":208.0,"y":1056.0,"connect0_ID":19.0,"portrait_ind":17.0,"ID":18.0,"text":"Uhhh. That's a good question.","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)"},{"x":448.0,"y":1056.0,"portrait_ind":37.0,"ID":19.0,"text":"Why DO I keep talking to him?<break>Huh?","portrait":"@ref sprite(spr_portrait_buster)"}],"events":[],"cam_zoom_count":0.0,"portraits":[],"camx":1764.833251953125,"camy":1267.5,"choices":[],"ID_TOTAL":20.0,"comments":[{"x":736.0,"y":944.0,"text":"Second interaction"},{"x":752.0,"y":1136.0,"text":"Lift off"}],"starting_node":-4.0}